      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to bring to the market 7 McSwiney Street, Dundalk, Co. Louth. No.7 brings an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located three-bedroom property in Dundalk, offering generous living accommodation arranged over two floors\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming living room, separate sitting room, kitchen, and bathroom, providing excellent flexibility for family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three bedrooms, making it an ideal home for families, first-time buyers, or investors.\r\n\r\nWith well-sized accommodation arranged over two floors, this property offers great potential and is conveniently located close to Dundalk town centre, with easy access to local shops, schools, amenities, transport links and services.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
